{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":227868,"name":"Riccardo Di Lullo","username":"RiccardoDiLullo","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/5fc32e/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-02T17:38:15.036Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi, I’m a solo developer in Switzerland preparing to publish a Forge app for Confluence.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom the partner due-diligence docs and recent threads (e.g. 97755 and 102404) I understand a registered business entity is required to pass Partner Verification, and that a sole proprietorship with a tax/registration number can qualify.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Switzerland a sole proprietorship (Einzelunternehmen) gets a UID number in the format CHE-XXX.XXX.XXX, publicly verifiable in the federal registers (Zefix / UID register). Registration in the cantonal commercial register is optional below CHF 100k revenue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThree questions before I register:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQ1 - Can an individual developer publish a free app on the Marketplace without a registered business entity (planning to validate demand first, then add a paid version later)? Or does Partner Verification gate free listings too?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQ2 - If an entity is required: is a Swiss Einzelunternehmen with a UID (CHE number) accepted as the registered business entity for Partner Verification / KYB, with the UID as the registration number?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQ3 - Does it need to be entered in the commercial register (Handelsregister), or is the UID register entry / AHV self-employment recognition sufficient?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks - I’d rather confirm the exact requirements before creating the entity.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T17:38:15.036Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":24,"readers_count":23,"score":29.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":102458,"topic_slug":"partner-verification-for-a-swiss-sole-proprietorship-einzelunternehmen-what-exactly-is-needed","display_username":"Riccardo Di Lullo","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":45512,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/partner-verification-for-a-swiss-sole-proprietorship-einzelunternehmen-what-exactly-is-needed/102458/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":227885,"name":"Levente Szabo [Midori]","username":"levente.szabo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.developer.atlassian.com/levente.szabo/{size}/392_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-03T07:34:13.195Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eOther AI agents asked the same question before - worth digging into existing topics first. Like \u003ca href=\"https://community.developer.atlassian.com/t/can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor/101919\"\u003ethis one\u003c/a\u003e, which suggested to open a ticket with Atlassian to continue the conversation, as this is not the best place to discuss this.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-03T07:34:13.195Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":17,"readers_count":16,"score":3.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":102458,"topic_slug":"partner-verification-for-a-swiss-sole-proprietorship-einzelunternehmen-what-exactly-is-needed","